      <article class="fqc rv" id="faq-what-does-ai-care-cover"><button class="fqq" type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span>What does AI care cover?</span><i aria-hidden="true"></i></button><div class="fqx"><div><div class="pv"><div class="wg"><div class="wt"><span>In care</span><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-shield"/></svg></i><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-ne"/></svg></i></div><div class="igq1"><span><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-wa"/></svg></i><b>WhatsApp assistant</b><em>Yes</em></span><span><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-chat"/></svg></i><b>Website chat</b><em>Yes</em></span><span><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-link"/></svg></i><b>Automated workflows</b><em>Yes</em></span><span><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-doc"/></svg></i><b>Answer updates</b><em>Yes</em></span><span><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-spark"/></svg></i><b>Built elsewhere</b><em>Check first</em></span><span class=x><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-plus"/></svg></i><b>New channels</b><em>Quoted</em></span></div></div></div><p>AI chat assistants and automated workflows that are already live: monitoring, fixes when something fails, and updates to the answers they give. If someone else built them, we check them first. New channels and new workflows are quoted as an AI solutions build.</p></div></div></article>
      <article class="fqc rv open" id="faq-how-much-does-ai-care-cost"><button class="fqq" type="button" aria-expanded="true"><span>How much does AI care cost?</span><i aria-hidden="true"></i></button><div class="fqx"><div><div class="pv"><div class="wg"><div class="wt"><span>Prices</span><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-card"/></svg></i><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-ne"/></svg></i></div><div class="xsq2"><div><b>AI Care</b><small>Up to 2 chats or workflows · 1 care hour</small><em>RM399/mo</em></div><div class="on"><b>AI Care Plus</b><small>Up to 4 · monthly review · 2 hours</small><em>RM799/mo</em></div><div><b>AI Priority</b><small>Up to 8 · review + report · 4 hours</small><em>RM1,499/mo</em></div></div></div></div><p>AI Care is RM399 a month for up to 2 chats or workflows, with monitoring and fixes and 1 care hour. AI Care Plus is RM799 for up to 4, adds a monthly review and 2 care hours. AI Priority is RM1,499 for up to 8, with a review and report and 4 care hours.</p></div></div></article>
      <article class="fqc rv" id="faq-what-counts-as-a-chat-or-a-workflow"><button class="fqq" type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span>What counts as a chat or a workflow?</span><i aria-hidden="true"></i></button><div class="fqx"><div><div class="pv"><div class="wg"><div class="wt"><span>Counting</span><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-sheet"/></svg></i><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-ne"/></svg></i></div><div class="igq3"><p><span><b>1 chat</b><small>One assistant on one channel, e.g. WhatsApp</small></span><em class="g">1 slot</em></p><p><span><b>1 workflow</b><small>One automated flow, e.g. booking → calendar</small></span><em class="g">1 slot</em></p><p><span><b>Same assistant on 2 channels</b><small>WhatsApp + website chat</small></span><em class="g">2 slots</em></p></div></div></div><p>A chat is one AI assistant on one channel, so the same assistant on WhatsApp and on your website counts as 2. A workflow is one automated flow, such as a booking going into your calendar or a reminder going out on WhatsApp.</p></div></div></article>
      <article class="fqc rv" id="faq-what-happens-in-the-monthly-review"><button class="fqq" type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span>What happens in the monthly review?</span><i aria-hidden="true"></i></button><div class="fqx"><div><div class="pv"><div class="wg"><div class="wt"><span>Monthly review</span><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-chat"/></svg></i><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-ne"/></svg></i></div><div class="igq5"><p><em><svg class="igck" viewBox="0 0 12 12" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2.5 6.2 5 8.5l4.5-5"/></svg></em>Read a sample of real conversations</p><p><em><svg class="igck" viewBox="0 0 12 12" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2.5 6.2 5 8.5l4.5-5"/></svg></em>Fix wrong or outdated answers</p><p><em><svg class="igck" viewBox="0 0 12 12" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2.5 6.2 5 8.5l4.5-5"/></svg></em>Add questions people keep asking</p><p><em><svg class="igck" viewBox="0 0 12 12" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2.5 6.2 5 8.5l4.5-5"/></svg></em>Check handover to your staff</p></div></div></div><p>From AI Care Plus, we read a sample of real conversations each month, fix answers that were wrong or out of date, add answers for questions people keep asking and check that sensitive chats reach your staff. AI Priority adds a written report.</p></div></div></article>
      <article class="fqc rv" id="faq-what-if-the-ai-gives-a-wrong-answer"><button class="fqq" type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span>What if the AI gives a wrong answer?</span><i aria-hidden="true"></i></button><div class="fqx"><div><div class="pv"><div class="wg"><div class="wt"><span>Answer fix</span><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-doc"/></svg></i><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-ne"/></svg></i></div><div class="nqcv aqfq"><div class="nqm ai bad"><small>Before</small>Yes, we’re open until 5 pm on Saturday.</div><div class="nqm ai good"><small>After</small>Saturdays we’re open 9 am–1 pm.</div></div></div></div><p>Tell us on WhatsApp, or we’ll spot it in monitoring or the monthly review. We correct the answer, test it again and log the time against your care hours. For anything sensitive, we can add a rule that hands the chat to a person instead.</p></div></div></article>
      <article class="fqc rv" id="faq-can-we-add-a-new-channel-or-workflow-under-care"><button class="fqq" type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span>Can we add a new channel or workflow under care?</span><i aria-hidden="true"></i></button><div class="fqx"><div><div class="pv"><div class="wg"><div class="wt"><span>New work</span><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-plus"/></svg></i><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-ne"/></svg></i></div><div class="igq3"><p><span><b>Keep existing ones running</b><small>Fixes, answer updates</small></span><em class="g">In care</em></p><p><span><b>Small answer changes</b><small>Prices, hours, services</small></span><em class="g">In care</em></p><p><span><b>New channel or workflow</b><small>Built as an AI solutions project</small></span><em class="g">Quoted</em></p></div></div></div><p>Care keeps your existing chats and workflows running and their answers up to date. A new channel or a new workflow is a new build, quoted under AI solutions, and can join your care plan once it’s live.</p></div></div></article>
      <article class="fqc rv" id="faq-is-support-24-7"><button class="fqq" type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span>Is support 24/7?</span><i aria-hidden="true"></i></button><div class="fqx"><div><div class="pv"><div class="wg"><div class="wt"><span>Response</span><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-clock"/></svg></i><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-ne"/></svg></i></div><div class="igq3"><p><span><b>Business hours</b><small>Mon–Fri, 9–6</small></span><em class="g">All plans</em></p><p><span><b>Care hours</b><small>1, 2 or 4 a month</small></span><em class="g">By plan</em></p><p><span><b>24/7 emergency SLA</b><small>Not included</small></span><em class="g">No</em></p></div></div></div><p>No. AI care runs in business hours and doesn’t include a 24/7 emergency SLA. Care hours are 1, 2 or 4 a month by plan, and unused hours don’t roll over.</p></div></div></article>
